---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
const MAIL = 'mailto:zhiqian.chen@rit.edu?subject=';
---
<Layout title="Prospective Students | Zhiqian Chen">
  <main class="container">
    <Nav current="students" />

    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Prospective Students</h1>
      <p class="lead">I take students on three tracks. Please read the one that fits you.</p>
      <nav class="jump" aria-label="Tracks">
        <a href="#phd">Ph.D. students</a>
        <a href="#intern">Research interns</a>
        <a href="#capstone">Capstone and independent study</a>
      </nav>
    </section>

    <section class="track-block" id="phd">
      <div class="track-head">
        <h2>Ph.D. students</h2>
        <a class="email-btn" href={MAIL + 'Prospective%20Ph.D.%20student'}><i class="fas fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i>Email me</a>
      </div>
      <p>I am looking for Ph.D. students starting at RIT in Spring 2027 or Fall 2027. To work with me, apply to the Ph.D. program of the Department of Computer Science, Golisano College of Computing and Information Sciences, Rochester Institute of Technology. If you are already at RIT, feel free to email me, schedule a meeting, or stop by my office.</p>
      <p class="email-note"><strong>In your email</strong>, please include your CV, your transcript, and two or three sentences on your research experience, with links. I read many inquiries, and I may not be able to follow up on emails that leave this out.</p>

      <h3>Basic requirements</h3>
      <ul class="reqs">
        <li>A background in engineering, computer science, mathematics or a related field</li>
        <li>Solid coding skills</li>
        <li>Solid mathematics</li>
        <li>Genuine passion and motivation for research</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 id="research-experience">Research experience (required)</h3>
      <p>A Ph.D. is a research degree, and the best sign that someone will thrive in one is that they have already done research. This is the one requirement I do not waive.</p>
      <ul class="reqs">
        <li><strong>The clearest evidence is a paper</strong>, published, accepted, or under review, to which you made a substantial contribution. A first-author paper at a strong venue in AI or your own field is ideal.</li>
        <li><strong>No paper yet? That can be fine</strong>, as long as you have done real research. Tell me concretely what question you worked on, what you did yourself, and what came out of it, such as a thesis, a preprint, a technical report, code, or a poster. A note from the person who supervised you helps.</li>
        <li>Coursework, course projects, and engineering-only internships usually do not count as research experience on their own.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you are still building research experience, a great way to start is an independent research project, beyond coursework, supervised by a faculty member. It can be at your own school, with my group (remote is welcome), or at any other institution.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="track-block" id="intern">
      <div class="track-head">
        <h2>Research interns</h2>
        <a class="email-btn" href={MAIL + 'Research%20intern'}><i class="fas fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i>Email me</a>
      </div>
      <p>Both remote and in-person interns are welcome, and high school students are welcome to apply as well. Openings come up throughout the year, sometimes on a monthly basis, and are filled case by case.</p>
      <p class="email-note"><strong>In your email</strong>, please include your CV and a short note on what you would like to work on. I will keep you in mind for the next suitable project.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="track-block" id="capstone">
      <div class="track-head">
        <h2>Capstone and independent study</h2>
        <a class="email-btn" href={MAIL + 'Capstone%20or%20independent%20study'}><i class="fas fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i>Email me</a>
      </div>
      <p>If your degree program requires a capstone project, or you would like to do an independent study for credit, I am open to supervising projects in my research areas.</p>
      <p class="email-note"><strong>In your email</strong>, please include a short note on your program and the kind of project you have in mind. Reach out early in the semester before you plan to start.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  :root { --accent:#C45200; --ink:#16202B; --muted:#4E5C6A; }
  .container { max-width: min(95vw, 1600px); margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; }

  .hero { margin: 10px 0 28px; }
  .hero h1 { font-family:'et-book',Palatino,serif; font-size:2rem; margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--ink); }
  .hero .lead { margin: 0 0 6px; color:#2E3A47; font-size:1rem; }
  .hero .contact { margin: 0; color:var(--muted); font-size:.92rem; }
  .hero .lead a, .hero .contact a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  .hero .contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .hero .lead { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px 14px; }
  .hero .lead a.email-btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--accent); color:#fff; font-size:.88rem; font-weight:600; }
  .hero .lead a.email-btn:hover { background:#A84600; }

  .jump { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 10px; margin-top:6px; }
  .jump a { color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; font-size:.92rem; border:1px solid #FAD6BA; border-radius:999px; padding:3px 12px; background:#fff; }
  .jump a:hover { background:#FDF1E7; }
  .track-block { background:#EEF3F8; padding:18px 22px; margin-top:20px; scroll-margin-top:80px; }
  .track-head { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px 16px; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .track-block h2 { font-family:'et-book',Palatino,serif; font-size:1.35rem; margin:0; color:var(--ink); }
  .track-block h3 { font-family:'et-book',Palatino,serif; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; color:#16202B; margin:20px 0 8px; }
  .track-block > p { color:#2E3A47; font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.55; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .track-block > p.email-note { background:#FDF1E7; border-radius:6px; padding:9px 13px; }
  .reqs { margin:0 0 10px; padding-left:20px; color:#2E3A47; font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.55; text-align:left; }
  .reqs li { margin-bottom:5px; }
  a.email-btn { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--accent); color:#fff; font-size:.88rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; }
  a.email-btn:hover { background:#A84600; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .track-block { padding:14px 14px; } }
</style>
